# Edge redirects for the admin-only web deployment.
# Copied verbatim into dist/ by `expo export -p web`.
#
# The web build is the admin platform only, so the root path is sent straight to
# /admin at the edge — the client-side gate would otherwise have to do it after
# the bundle loads.
/    /admin    302

# Do NOT add a `/* /index.html 200` catch-all here: redirect rules are applied
# even when a real asset matches the request, so a catch-all would shadow the
# hashed JS bundles under /_expo/. The SPA fallback comes from
# `assets.not_found_handling = "single-page-application"` in wrangler.toml
# instead (Cloudflare Pages does the same fallback automatically when the
# deployment has no 404.html).
